Websites Used
1. https://www.saucedemo.com
2. https://demoqa.com
Test Cases
Website 1: SauceDemo
1. Open the website.
2. Enter valid Username and Password.
3. Click the Login button.
4. Verify the Products page is displayed.
5. Add a product to the cart.
Website 2: DemoQA
1. Open the website.
2. Navigate to Widgets → Select Menu.
3. Select a value from the dropdown menu.
4. Go to Elements → Text Box.
5. Fill the form with Name, Email, Current Address, and Permanent Address.
6. Click Submit.
7. Verify the entered details are displayed.
Procedure
1. Install Selenium IDE in the browser.
2. Create a new project.
3. Create a test suite.
4. Record test cases for both websites.
5. Save the test cases.
6. Run the complete test suite.
7. Check the execution logs and test results.
Expected Result
 Login should be successful on SauceDemo.
 Product should be added to the cart.
 Dropdown value should be selected successfully.
 Form should be submitted successfully.
 Entered details should be displayed correctly.
